usic-Melodic Instruments</b></td>\r\n    <td height=\"5\" vAlign=\"top\" align=\"left\" width=\"250\"><b><a href=\"web_material/SQP/ClassX_2024_25/CarnaticMelodicInstrument-SQP.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">SQP</a></b> </td>\r\n    <td><b><a href=\"web_material/SQP/ClassX_2024_25/CarnaticMelodicInstrument-MS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">MS</a></b> </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td height=\"5\" vAlign=\"top\" align=\"left\" width=\"250\"><b>Carnatic Music-Percussion Instruments</b></td>\r\n    <td height=\"5\" vAlign=\"top\" align=\"left\" width=\"250\"><b><a href=\"web_material/SQP/ClassX_2024_25/CarnaticMusicPercussion-SQP.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">SQP</a></b> </td>\r\n    <td><b><a href=\"web_material/SQP/ClassX_2024_25/CarnaticMusicPercussion-MS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">MS</a></b> </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td height=\"5\" vAlign=\"top\" align=\"left\" width=\"250\"><b>Carnatic Music-Vocal</b></td>\r\n    <td height=\"5\" vAlign=\"top\" align=\"left\" width=\"250\"><b><a href=\"web_material/SQP/ClassX_2024_25/CarnaticMusicVocal-SQP.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">SQP</a></b> </td>\r\n    <td><b><a href=\"web_material/SQP/ClassX_2024_25/CarnaticMusicVocal-MS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">MS</a></b> </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td height=\"5\" vAlign=\"top\" align=\"left\" width=\"250\"><b>Painting</b></td>\r\n    <td height=\"5\" vAlign=\"top\" align=\"left\" width=\"250\"><b><a href=\"web_material/SQP/ClassX_2024_25/Painting-SQP.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">SQP</a></b> </td>\r\n    <td><b><a href=\"web_material/SQP/ClassX_2024_25/Painting-MS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">MS</a></b> </td>\r\n    </tr>\r\n  <tr>\r\n    <td height=\"5\" vAlign=\"top\" align=\"left\" width=\"250\"><b>Arabic</b></td>\r\n    <td height=\"5\" vAlign=\"top\" align=\"left\" width=\"250\"><b><a href=\"web_material/SQP/ClassX_2024_25/Arabic-SQP.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">SQP</a></b> </td>\r\n    <td><b><a href=\"web_material/SQP/ClassX_2024_25/Arabic-MS.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">MS</a></b> </td>\r\n    </tr>\r